        "source_quote": "方得進路，臺城陷，侯景遣前臨江太守董紹先以高祖手敕召會理，其僚佐咸勸距之。",
        "reading": "臺城陷後，董紹先奉梁武帝手敕召會理，僚佐勸阻。",
        "note": "臺城陷後，董紹先奉梁武帝手敕召會理，僚佐勸阻。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 52,
        "end_codepoint": 89,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-89",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "會理曰：「諸君心事，與我不同，天子年尊，受制賊虜，今有手敕召我入朝，臣子之心，豈得違背。",
        "reading": "會理向僚佐說明入京決定，天子指梁武帝。",
        "note": "會理向僚佐說明入京決定，天子指梁武帝。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 89,
        "end_codepoint": 133,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-133",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "且遠處江北，功業難成，不若身赴京都，圖之肘腋。",
        "reading": "續述遠處江北，難圖反正。",
        "note": "續述遠處江北，難圖反正。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 133,
        "end_codepoint": 156,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-156",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "吾計決矣。」",
        "reading": "以「吾計決矣」作結。",
        "note": "以「吾計決矣」作結。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 156,
        "end_codepoint": 162,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-162",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "遂席捲而行，以城輸紹先。",
        "reading": "將城交董紹先，入京。",
        "note": "將城交董紹先，入京。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 162,
        "end_codepoint": 174,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-174",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "至京，景以爲侍中、司空、兼中書令。",
        "reading": "侯景任會理為侍中、司空、兼中書令。南史此處作司空兼尚書令。",
        "note": "侯景任會理為侍中、司空、兼中書令。南史此處作司空兼尚書令。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 174,
        "end_codepoint": 191,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-191",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "雖在寇手，每思匡復，與西鄉侯勸等潛布腹心，要結壯士。",
        "reading": "會理與西鄉侯勸等密謀匡復。",
        "note": "會理與西鄉侯勸等密謀匡復。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 191,
        "end_codepoint": 217,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-217",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "時范陽祖皓斬紹先，據廣陵城起義，期以會理爲內應。",
        "reading": "祖皓殺紹先、據廣陵起事，向會理求內應。",
        "note": "祖皓殺紹先、據廣陵起事，向會理求內應。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 217,
        "end_codepoint": 241,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-241",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "皓敗，辭相連及，景矯詔免會理官，猶以白衣領尚書令。",
        "reading": "祖皓敗後，侯景矯詔免會理官，仍白衣領尚書令。",
        "note": "祖皓敗後，侯景矯詔免會理官，仍白衣領尚書令。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 241,
        "end_codepoint": 266,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "是冬，景往晉熙，景師虛弱，會理復與柳敬禮謀之。",
        "reading": "侯景冬出晉熙，會理與柳敬禮起謀；殿本作「京師虛弱」。",
        "note": "侯景冬出晉熙，會理與柳敬禮起謀；殿本作「京師虛弱」。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 23,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-23",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "敬禮曰：「舉大事必有所資，今無寸兵，安可以動？」",
        "reading": "柳敬禮先以無兵反問。",
        "note": "柳敬禮先以無兵反問。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 23,
        "end_codepoint": 47,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-47",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "會理曰：「湖熟有吾舊兵三千餘人，昨來相知，克期響集，聽吾日定，便至京師。",
        "reading": "會理說在湖熟有三千餘故兵，約其集京師。",
        "note": "會理說在湖熟有三千餘故兵，約其集京師。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 47,
        "end_codepoint": 83,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-83",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "計賊守兵不過千人耳，若大兵外攻，吾等內應，直取王偉，事必有成。",
        "reading": "會理擬內外相應取王偉。王偉是侯景部下，與此前渦陽城主異人。",
        "note": "會理擬內外相應取王偉。王偉是侯景部下，與此前渦陽城主異人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 83,
        "end_codepoint": 114,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-114",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "縱景後歸，無能爲也。」",
        "reading": "縱侯景回軍亦無能為，是會理所估。",
        "note": "縱侯景回軍亦無能為，是會理所估。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 114,
        "end_codepoint": 125,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-125",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "敬禮曰「善」，因贊成之。",
        "reading": "柳敬禮贊成。",
        "note": "柳敬禮贊成。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 125,
        "end_codepoint": 137,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-137",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "于時百姓厭賊，咸思用命，自丹陽至于京口，靡不同之。",
        "reading": "丹陽至京口人心厭亂。",
        "note": "丹陽至京口人心厭亂。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 137,
        "end_codepoint": 162,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence3-162",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
        "source_quote": "後事不果，與弟祁陽侯通理並遇害。",
        "reading": "事敗，會理與弟通理同遇害。卷中未定日，南史補記洩謀與王偉繫獄到害之始末。",
        "note": "事敗，會理與弟通理同遇害。卷中未定日，南史補記洩謀與王偉繫獄到害之始末。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 162,
        "end_codepoint": 178,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence4-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CB",
        "source_quote": "通理字仲宣，位太子洗馬，封祁陽侯。",
        "reading": "通理字仲宣，官太子洗馬、封祁陽侯；殿本在遇害句後直連乂理，南史保本段官位。",
        "note": "通理字仲宣，官太子洗馬、封祁陽侯；殿本在遇害句後直連乂理，南史保本段官位。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 17,
        "human_reviewed": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "text": "子會理嗣，字長才。少聰慧，好文史。年十一而孤，特爲高祖所愛，衣服禮秩與正王不殊。年十五，拜輕車將軍、湘州刺史，又領石頭戍軍事。遷侍中，兼領軍將軍。尋除宣惠將軍、丹陽尹，置佐史。出爲使持節、都督南北兗北徐青冀東徐譙七州諸軍事、平北將軍、南兗州刺史。太清元年，督衆軍北討，至彭城，爲魏師所敗，退歸本鎮。",
